#### [NEW] [ragController.js](file:///c:/Users/Computer%20Arena/Documents/webDev%20works/full%20stack/SkillSync/Backend/controllers/ragController.js)

Single endpoint handler:
- **`handleChat(req, res)`** — Validates input (`message` string, optional `history` array), calls `ragService.chat()`, returns `{ reply: string }`.
- Enforces recruiter-only access.

