## Data Flow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Recruiter (Browser)
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as Express Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant AI as Gemini API

    R->>FE: Types question in chat
    FE->>BE: POST /rag/chat {message, history}
    BE->>DB: Fetch recruiter's jobs
    BE->>DB: Fetch all applications (populated)
    BE->>BE: Extract resume text (PDF → text)
    BE->>BE: Build context document
    BE->>AI: Prompt (system + context + history + question)
    AI-->>BE: AI response
    BE-->>FE: {reply: "..."}
    FE-->>R: Display AI response in chat
```

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

#### Unit Test — `ragService.js`
Create `Backend/tests/unit/services/ragService.test.js`:
- Mock Gemini API and MongoDB queries
- Verify `buildApplicantContext` correctly assembles context from applicant data
- Verify `chat` sends the correct prompt structure to Gemini
- Run with: `node --test --test-timeout=60000 "tests/unit/services/ragService.test.js"`  (from [Backend/](file:///c:/Users/Computer%20Arena/Documents/webDev%20works/full%20stack/SkillSync/Frontend/src/config/runtime.js#30-36) directory)

#### Integration Test — `/rag/chat` endpoint
Create `Backend/tests/integration/rag.routes.test.js`:
- Test auth guard (401 without token, 403 for non-recruiter)
- Test successful chat response with mocked Gemini
- Run with: `node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-timeout=120000 "tests/integration/rag.routes.test.js"` (from [Backend/](file:///c:/Users/Computer%20Arena/Documents/webDev%20works/full%20stack/SkillSync/Frontend/src/config/runtime.js#30-36) directory)

### Manual Verification (Browser)
1. Start the backend (`npm run dev` in [Backend/](file:///c:/Users/Computer%20Arena/Documents/webDev%20works/full%20stack/SkillSync/Frontend/src/config/runtime.js#30-36))
2. Start the frontend (`npm run dev` in `Frontend/`)
3. Log in as a **recruiter** user
4. Navigate to the **Applicants** page
5. Verify a floating AI chat button appears in the bottom-right corner
6. Click it to open the chat panel
7. Type a question like *"Who are my top applicants?"*
8. Verify an AI response appears within a few seconds
9. Verify the chat maintains conversation context (follow-up questions work)
10. Verify the chat panel can be collapsed/expanded
